Z||000004||SCCA FIERO||07-25-99||01:34 AM||||The speedo assembly does come completely out with the odometer and tripmeter. I just took the 85mph face off and glued the 120mph on in it's place. The capacitor is on a circut board under the assembly.<p>A 250mph speedo? Oh yeah, I am gonna get a 255mph speedo.....LOL. That GT I posted "Awesome GT" has a 220 mph speedo.<p>BTW...I will get that 1/4 window to ya one of these days  :)
